@LatestNews.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5221
@ArticleId = A7100000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002

### Create article

POST {{LatestNews.API_HostAddress}}/api/articles
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

Title=Technology%20and%20education&Theme=technology%20in%20education&Category=Technology&Image=https%3A%2F%2Fexample.com%2Farticle.jpg&GenerateAudio=false

### Get all articles

GET {{LatestNews.API_HostAddress}}/api/articles
Accept: application/json

### Get article by id

GET {{LatestNews.API_HostAddress}}/api/articles/{{ArticleId}}
Accept: application/json

### Update article by id
PUT {{LatestNews.API_HostAddress}}/api/articles/{{ArticleId}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

Title=Updated%20article&Category=Technology&BasicText=Simple%20article%20text.&AdvancedText=Detailed%20article%20text.

### Delete article by id
DELETE {{LatestNews.API_HostAddress}}/api/articles/{{ArticleId}}
Accept: application/json

### Get paginated articles (filters are applied before pagination)
GET {{LatestNews.API_HostAddress}}/api/articles/paged?page=1&pageSize=6&search=&category=
Accept: application/json

### Get second page
GET {{LatestNews.API_HostAddress}}/api/articles/paged?page=2&pageSize=6
Accept: application/json

### Invalid pagination returns 400
GET {{LatestNews.API_HostAddress}}/api/articles/paged?page=0&pageSize=101
Accept: application/json
